[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2988117459","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#issuecomment-2988117459","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/23","id":2988117459,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc6yGw3T","user":{"login":"Artui","id":15174053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc0MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15174053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui","html_url":"https://github.com/Artui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-19T13:32:40Z","updated_at":"2025-06-19T13:32:40Z","body":"@omarbenhamid do you mind having a look here? :) Your library looks really great, but for our use case we would like to re-use a bunch of existing views that are built as viewsets, which isn't supported yet?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2988117459/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2990086075","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#issuecomment-2990086075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/23","id":2990086075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc6yORe7","user":{"login":"omarbenhamid","id":1033063,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMzMwNjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1033063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid","html_url":"https://github.com/omarbenhamid","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omarbenhamid/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T07:16:39Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T07:16:39Z","body":"Interesting feature and PR. Ok, i'll be reviewing it for merge.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2990086075/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2991177222","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#issuecomment-2991177222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/23","id":2991177222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc6ySb4G","user":{"login":"Artui","id":15174053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc0MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15174053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui","html_url":"https://github.com/Artui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T11:45:06Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T11:45:06Z","body":"@omarbenhamid thanks! I also have a couple of questions.\r\n1.  Is there a reason to remove `authentication_classes` when initialising views as tools? DRF requests don't have a user set until the `_authenticate` method is called against `authentication_classes`, which messes a bit with logic that might depend on that. Do you mind if I add a switch in settings to actually use `DJANGO_MCP_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES` when doing `view_class.as_view`?\r\n2. I would also like to include some django_request posprocessing as a part of _DRFRequestWrapper, for passing some custom params into the request. Do you mind if I add as a part of this PR? ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2991177222/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2991505816","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#issuecomment-2991505816","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/23","id":2991505816,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc6yTsGY","user":{"login":"Artui","id":15174053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc0MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15174053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui","html_url":"https://github.com/Artui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T12:56:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T12:56:24Z","body":"> @omarbenhamid thanks! I also have a couple of questions.\r\n> \r\n> 1. Is there a reason to remove `authentication_classes` when initialising views as tools? DRF requests don't have a user set until the `_authenticate` method is called against `authentication_classes`, which messes a bit with logic that might depend on that. Do you mind if I add a switch in settings to actually use `DJANGO_MCP_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES` when doing `view_class.as_view`?\r\n> 2. I would also like to include some django_request posprocessing as a part of _DRFRequestWrapper, for passing some custom params into the request. Do you mind if I add as a part of this PR?\r\n\r\nI took a liberty of adding these toggles and post processing hooks support in the PR, if you don't mind, as only with those enabled our server would behave correctly. We're basically making a request on behalf of a user, so all permission and auth classes need to behave the same as they do for a regular API. I think that's a valid use case?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2991505816/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2998998984","html_url":"https://github.com/gts360/django-mcp-server/pull/23#issuecomment-2998998984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/23","id":2998998984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOOns7hc6ywRfI","user":{"login":"Artui","id":15174053,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTc0MDUz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15174053?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui","html_url":"https://github.com/Artui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Artui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T06:33:43Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T06:33:43Z","body":"@omarbenhamid hey - any guess when you might have some time to check this out? We'd really like to start using the updated library ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gts360/django-mcp-server/issues/comments/2998998984/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"p